[{"title":"浣溪沙 寿老母","author":"张辑","text":"夏果初收唤绿华。\n冰盘巧簇映金瓜。\n荷香飞上玉流霞。\n明月长留千岁色，蟠桃多结几番花。\n谁知罗带有丹砂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56989,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"断肠声/南歌子 寓南歌子","author":"张辑","text":"柳户朝云湿，花窗午篆清。\n东风未放十分晴。\n留恋海棠颜色、过清明。\n垒润栖新燕，笼深锁旧莺。\n琵琶可是不堪听。\n无奈愁人把做、断肠声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56990,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淮甸春/念奴娇 寓念奴娇丙申岁游高沙，访淮海事迹","author":"张辑","text":"短髯怀古，更文游台上，秋生吟兴。\n闻说坡仙来把酒，月底频留清影。\n极目平芜，孤城四水，画角西风劲。\n曲阑犹在，十分心事谁领。\n词卷空落人间，黄楼何处，回首愁深省。\n斜照寒鸦知几度，梦想当年名胜。\n只有山川，曾窥翰墨，仿佛馀风韵。\n旧游休问，柳花淮甸春冷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56991,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琐窗寒 怀旧寄林七膳部","author":"张辑","text":"露漏沈沈，洞房灯悄，鹊翻庭树。\n夜凉如水，人倚玉箫何处。\n澹纵横、疏星断河，点衣黄叶飞四五。\n向此时感旧，非关宋玉，悲秋情绪。\n追念章台路。\n共缓辔芳尘，妒花惹絮。\n旧游梦寐，总付相思新句。\n想风流还在匆匆，暗惊鬓底霜几缕。\n凭危栏、立尽归鸿，脆角凝清曙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56992,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绮罗香 寿赵太卿","author":"张辑","text":"欲雨凉生，初弦月在，画戟香中清啸。\n旋种芙蕖，深夏木兰芳沼。\n银汉入、天镜搀秋，福星度、雪阑争照。\n又谁写、万幅莼波，一江佳思到鱼鸟。\n吴儿眉语笑里，要见圜扉绿遍，平畴青绕。\n羽扇纶巾，萧洒玉貌长好。\n问千年、庆会风云，正此日、静春花草。\n更弦管、非雾非烟，鹤声帘幕晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56993,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"疏帘淡月 寓桂枝香秋思","author":"张辑","text":"梧桐雨细。\n渐滴作秋声，被风惊碎。\n润逼衣篝，线袅蕙炉沈水。\n悠悠岁月天涯醉。\n一分秋、一分憔悴。\n紫箫吟断，素笺恨切，夜寒鸿起。\n又何苦、凄凉客里。\n负草堂春绿，竹溪空翠。\n落叶西风，吹老几番尘世。\n从前谙尽江湖味。\n听商歌、归兴千里。\n露侵宿酒，疏帘淡月，照人无寐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56994,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"貂裘换酒/贺新郎 寓贺新郎乙未冬别冯可久","author":"张辑","text":"笛唤春风起。\n向湖边、腊前折柳，问君何意。\n孤负梅花立晴昼，一舸凄凉雪底。\n但小阁、琴棋而已。\n佳客清朝留不住，为康庐、只在家窗里。\n湓浦去，两程耳。\n草堂旧日谈经地。\n更从容、南山北水，庾楼重倚。\n万卷心胸几今古，牛斗多年紫气。\n正江上、风寒如此。\n且趁霜天鲈鱼好，把貂裘、换酒长安市。\n明夜去，月千里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56995,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阑干万里心/忆王孙 寓忆王孙","author":"张辑","text":"小楼柳色未春深。\n湘月牵情入苦吟。\n翠袖风前冷不禁。\n怕登临。\n几曲阑干万里心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56996,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"张辑","text":"醉发吹凉，但拂剑、狂歌而已。\n倩谁问、九霄黄鹤，更曾来未。\n玉女窗深松昼静，研朱重点参同契。\n记前回、赤水得玄珠，骊龙睡。\n空扰扰，人间世。\n除学道，无真是。\n把洪崖肩拍，挹浮丘袂。\n朝驾长风沧岛上，夜骑明月青天际。\n更几时、回首旧山川，三千岁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56997,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞鹤仙 寿赵右司","author":"张辑","text":"柳风双燕语。\n问有谁留人，岸花去橹。\n星辰快平步。\n俯圜扉草色，青青如许。\n儿童拥路。\n玉溪边、当年杜母。\n料从今、指点山川，总是绣衣行处。\n回顾。\n东堂深窈，楚帖长春，竹尊清午。\n红云帝所。\n摇佩玉，更容与。\n把蓬莱一笑，几番清浅，绿野为花作谱。\n向花前、三叠琴心，看苍鹤舞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56998,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧云深/忆秦娥 寓忆秦娥","author":"张辑","text":"风凄凄。\n井阑络纬惊秋啼。\n惊秋啼。\n凉侵好梦，月正楼西。\n卷帘望月知心谁。\n关河空隔长相思。\n长相思。\n碧云暮合，有美人兮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56999,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徵招","author":"张辑","text":"飞鸿又作秋空字，凄凄旧游湘浦。\n凉思带愁深，渺苍茫何许。\n岁华知几度。\n奈双鬓、不禁吟苦。\n独倚危楼，叶声摇暮，玉阑无语。\n尺素。\n欲传将，故人远、天涯屡惊回顾。\n心事只琴知，漫闲相尔汝。\n甚时江海去。\n算空负、白蘋鸥侣。\n更谁与、剪烛西窗，且醉听山雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57000,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉蓬莱 舟次东山忆西湖旧游","author":"张辑","text":"记澄湖抱练，画舫参差，闹花时节。\n油壁鸣堤，有障萦屏列。\n燕草香融，鸦条香浅，似渭城烟雪。\n急管斜阳，卫娘葱茜，带围寒怯。\n苏小闲情，绿杨如织，阑槛东边，好山千叠。\n料得如今，也翠销红歇。\n何限繁华，春来都付与，数声啼鴂。\n谩怆羁魂，扁舟买醉，谢公明月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57001,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 日暮","author":"张辑","text":"暮天云阔。\n懒泛琴三叠。\n恰有梅花相伴，窗儿上、一枝月。\n忆别。\n恁时节。\n吟情谁共说。\n敧枕偶成清梦，画角晓、更愁绝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57002,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞仙歌 游大涤赋","author":"张韫","text":"花泥絮浪，殢春怀如酒。\n书卷炉熏梦清昼。\n唤玉京稳携手松乔，飞光里，笑傲白云林岫。\n仙人犹狡狯，洒雪吹冰，声落星河翠蛟走。\n问箬下留丹，别已千年，华表鹤、亦归来否。\n有洞口、桃花识刘郎，共一笑相迎，朱颜如旧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57003,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清隐院","author":"张颐","text":"古寺深山里，高亭万木丛。\n归云度疏牖，绣岭倚晴空。\n涧草连阶绿，岩花照槛红。\n纵非尘世外，无异画图中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57004,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏莎行","author":"张魁","text":"凤髻堆鸦，香酥莹腻。\n雨中花占街前地。\n弓鞋湿透立多时，无人为问深深意。\n眉上新愁，手中文字。\n如何不倩鳞鸿去。\n想伊只诉薄情人，官中不管闲公事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57005,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"张鹏飞","text":"苍天定俾期颐寿，会看芸书聘五更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57006,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万安驿","author":"张演","text":"劲兵重卒付胡奴，驱雀驱鱼计自疏。\n地入万安知几许，却怜此日始回车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57007,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云岩寺","author":"张演","text":"栋宇何年有，云岩拥树深。\n山僧传旧险，诗者有行吟。\n云影侵巾屦，江声送古今。\n荔枝何用数，抚字每劳心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57008,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诸丈赓示前章再次韵","author":"张演","text":"桃李层层媚远天，碧芜映带绮成川。\n英灵旧有凌云赋，混一长看建武年。\n老去无知经世用，梦归欲问溯江船。\n请君妙语惊颓懒，一笑诗坛酒社边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57009,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅","author":"张演","text":"向来懒不赋梅诗，禅榻忘机鬓已丝。\n月户忽逢双玉立，春风又见一年期。\n楼高缥缈明霜影，竹冷横斜浸雪枝。\n尚笑閒尘除未尽，暗香犹著梦魂知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57010,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题三峡堂","author":"张演","text":"群山危立接云天，一水东朝会百川。\n泱漭堪舆无此壮，崔嵬疏凿定何年。\n千秋跃马兴亡梦，一点飞凫上下船。\n时有刚风来浩渺，起予高兴九秋边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57011,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题沔州诸葛武侯庙","author":"张演","text":"赤伏终休运，前营落大星。\n皇王空礼乐，江汉閟英灵。\n断垄牛羊入，空山草木青。\n经时须此牧，清泪洒泉扃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57012,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次袁说友巫山十二峰古风二十五韵","author":"张演","text":"化工神伟开物姿，劖石万仞不作痴。\n巍峰耸立威凤举，急挟怒流奔马迟。\n隐然万里形胜重，信矣四海游观奇。\n天开匹练势巀嶪，云拥列嶂青参差。\n舆图悚视天设险，舟楫竞与江东之。\n何年宇宙此盘据，远揽泰华宜肩随。\n胸吞云梦荡物表，眦决飞鸟忘神疲。\n元戎授任盛节制，列舰径度罗旌旗。\n天香来时满衣袖，讲殿几日辞书帷。\n词源浩荡春峡水，句律飘扬秋桂枝。\n天门有路穿水去，笔力到古群峰低。\n远参退之赋山囿，下陋樊川娱水嬉。\n有神相宅理应尔，梦赋靡曼奚其为。\n流转不根怜已久，高咏取正今逢时。\n昔年飞挽忝将指，异境名言犹念兹。\n大篇巨轴窥胜赏，赤甲白盐神坐驰。\n有从绝唱发奇伟，众作绚采同彰施。\n德风草偃阃以外，观颂下转江之湄。\n宁须三年奏汉计，行复八彩瞻尧眉。\n慈恩论契肯隔面，草堂枉驾欣解颐。\n我方卧云书自伴，公咏入相衣宜缁。\n少须凋瘵尽抚摩，大赈廪粟歌噫嘻。\n会看丹诏来北阙，更上岷岭登峨嵋。\n江山得助协嘉会，赓载归写明良诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57013,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉陪安抚大卿登八阵台览观忠武侯诸葛公遗像偶成长句","author":"张演","text":"白帝城西鱼腹浦，十月江平见津浒。\n当年累石纷成行，此地卧龙经讲武。\n辕门外建严中权，列阵相承存后伍。\n何人蛇势识常山，未数鱼丽矜郑拒。\n悬知精神贯金石，尚想号令严钲鼓。\n老兵料敌应疑生，川后澄波其敢侮。\n向令赤伏有遗符，下睨皇州直指取。\n云何遗迹司神明，独靳丰功被寰宇。\n高城置酒供临眺，往事兴怀增叹抚。\n巍然王佐三代前，信矣名言照千古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57014,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题碧落洞","author":"张熙","text":"大豁□幽彻洞天，分明平地有蓬山。\n朝元□□归何晚，故敞瑶扃白日闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57015,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄嘉兴守令狐挺","author":"张瑴","text":"羡君席上碧云句，吟尽江南烟雨村。\n岂惜笙歌连夜醉，且看风物逐春新。\n花开花落何时尽，闲是闲非愁杀人。\n何似阳台云畔曲，细声拂拂下梁尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57016,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋秋江图","author":"张端义","text":"浪静风平月正中，自摇柔橹驾孤篷。\n若无三万六千顷，把甚江湖著此翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57017,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽周晋仙","author":"张端义","text":"策杖辞朋友，形骸已可怜。\n无钱亲药裹，冒雨上归船。\n官竟生前弃，诗应死后传。\n空馀京洛月，愁照月台边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57018,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"张端义","text":"怨春红艳冷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57019,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倦寻芳","author":"张端义","text":"晓听社雨，犹带馀寒，尚侵襟袖。\n插柳千门，相近禁烟时候。\n鬓坠搔头深旧恨，臂宽条脱添新瘦。\n卷重帘，看双飞燕羽，舞庭花昼。\n谁共语、春来怕酒。\n一段情怀，灯暗更后。\n罨画屏山，今夜梦魂还又。\n愁墨题笺鱼浪远，粉香染泪鲛绡透。\n待相逢，想鸳衾、凤帏依旧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57020,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"张端义","text":"不因花退尽，必是梦残时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57021,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"张端义","text":"碧云千里暮，红叶十分秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57022,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆秦人洞","author":"张翠屏","text":"溪上桃花无数开，花间秋水绿于苔。\n不因渔父寻源入，争识仙家避世来。\n翠雨连云流玉洞，丹霞护日抱瑶台。\n幔亭亦有红桥约，问我京华几日回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57023,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁未立春","author":"张镃","text":"今岁春从底处回，非关缇室动葭灰。\n幽人昨夜池塘梦，已见新春草际来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57024,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕口占","author":"张镃","text":"凉生金井未飘桐，月户星楼记古风。\n乞巧频年但成拙，懒将祈请效儿童。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57025,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕池上泛舟四首 其四","author":"张镃","text":"夜雨连明旋出奇，涨平荷盖失参差。\n更教红莟肩齐水，要学湘妃晓浴时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57026,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕池上泛舟四首 其三","author":"张镃","text":"柳系荃桡句未成，拨船微动碧香迎。\n琉璃自爱无瑕翳，不放池西一叶生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57027,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕池上泛舟四首 其二","author":"张镃","text":"秋入冯夷碧殿凉，仙游十万不分行。\n锦蜺香满烟蒙伞，翠凤光浮露涤裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57028,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕池上泛舟四首 其一","author":"张镃","text":"居士乘閒养就痴，争如灵鹊自知时。\n不从楼上求新巧，却向船中赋拙诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57029,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"张镃","text":"重阳冷菊青黄蕊，半醉幽人黑白头。\n今岁有番堪恨处，病无诗句过中秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57030,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月望日微雨汎舟西湖四首 其四","author":"张镃","text":"堤树枝条老更成，岂容他处夏阴清。\n东风不惜吹芳草，绿满鹅儿燕子情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57031,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月望日微雨汎舟西湖四首 其三","author":"张镃","text":"倭缬帘垂柳外楼，靓妆微露玉搔头。\n承平气象应如此，忆杀金明水殿游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57032,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月望日微雨汎舟西湖四首 其二","author":"张镃","text":"非是天悭一日晴，晦明多态属诗人。\n云翻画样烘濛墨，波捲纹头起突银。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57033,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月望日微雨汎舟西湖四首 其一","author":"张镃","text":"清明才过雨连风，着色湖山便面中。\n草上踏青人自出，舣船无地不飞红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57034,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行","author":"张镃","text":"鸟飞不过人行处，山好直连天尽头。\n下马忽逢难画景，溜声戛玉亦销忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57035,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山堂","author":"张镃","text":"芒鞋疏到笋篱东，惯得苍苔把径封。\n已愧君诗足真味，尚将鸡肋较驼峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57036,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书北厅后檐壁","author":"张镃","text":"重阳过后雨垂垂，病怯新寒独立时。\n菊有万株归未得，一窗来此看花枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57037,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书叶轩 其二","author":"张镃","text":"正是桐阴雨乍晴，隔笼黄鸟女儿声。\n笔床经笥閒家具，物物皆从我太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57038,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书叶轩 其一","author":"张镃","text":"当处心安即洞天，黄连一炷胜龙涎。\n閒房幸自无人到，谁放白云来枕前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57039,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书苍寒堂壁二首 其二","author":"张镃","text":"一灯清坐欲三更，月到疏棂胧松明。\n除了当栏松上鹊，无人听得读书声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57040,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书苍寒堂壁二首 其一","author":"张镃","text":"隔竹红梅酷似桃，政宜修涧绿周遭。\n武陵风景何时别，不绝人来意更高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57041,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云露堂","author":"张镃","text":"种玉栽琼树树匀，主人心地况长春。\n便教不假云间路，亦有芳菲日日新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57042,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五家林四首 其四","author":"张镃","text":"散乱飞鸿掠快晴，嗈嗈那复苦寒声。\n定知已入新诗了，才过余舟便不鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57043,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五家林四首 其三","author":"张镃","text":"草木敷荣怕入秋，霜天却自不穷愁。\n弹丸都把黄金铸，乱挂枯疏冻树头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57044,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五家林四首 其二","author":"张镃","text":"岸转欣逢撇撇儿，蹙成千步响琉璃。\n没波岂但寻鱼吃，水不能濡只我知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57045,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五家林四首 其一","author":"张镃","text":"放鸭成群趁暖晖，村童遮护只狂飞。\n多多益办真难事，半里撑船赶不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57046,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从张子立觅驴二绝 其二","author":"张镃","text":"几回曾许借侬骑，兴到牵来已早迟。\n乞与南湖了幽事，白裘乌帽要相宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57047,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从张子立觅驴二绝 其一","author":"张镃","text":"蹇驴休爱鸽毛青，指日骅骝辇路行。\n听水听松方属我，灞桥风雪可寒盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57048,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以桂隐樱桃从益之博红酒诗","author":"张镃","text":"闻道君家琥珀霞，杭州那更说梨花。\n樱桃颗颗堪持比，换取一尊来水涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57049,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分韵赋散水花得盐字 其一","author":"张镃","text":"春皇游骑玉垂鞭，珠捲扬州十里帘。\n一笑诗成休浪举，花如西子句无盐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57050,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分韵赋散水花得盐字 其二","author":"张镃","text":"盈枝点缀雪花鲜，环映清流分外妍。\n应是东君归骑速，不如坠下玉丝鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57051,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分韵赋散水花得盐字 其三","author":"张镃","text":"苔径斜通砌竹鞭，素光交映入湘帘。\n若教谢女庭前种，不道空中雪似盐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57052,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分题得古木","author":"张镃","text":"穴处曾经起怒雷，断藤枯藓半离披。\n根茎托土何妨远，会见春风长活枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57053,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]